  'games.mnemonicContext': {
    'en-US': 'Given the key signature mnemonics:\n- Sharps: \'Father Charles Goes Down And Ends Battle\' (F C G D A E B). Moving forward = more sharps. C has 0 sharps, G has 1 sharp, etc.\n- Flats: \'Battle Ends And Down Goes Charles\\\' Father\' (B E A D G C F). Moving forward = more flats. Bb has 2 flats, Eb has 3 flats, etc.\nHint: The sequence wraps around.',
    'vi-VN': 'Mẹo nhớ dấu hóa:\n- Thăng: \'Father Charles Goes Down And Ends Battle\' (F C G D A E B). Đi tiếp là thêm dấu thăng. C có 0 dấu thăng, G có 1 dấu thăng, v.v.\n- Giáng: \'Battle Ends And Down Goes Charles\\\' Father\' (B E A D G C F). Đi tiếp là thêm dấu giáng. Bb có 2 dấu giáng, Eb có 3 dấu giáng, v.v.\nGợi ý: Dãy này vòng lại.',
    'zh-CN': '调号口诀：\n- 升号：\'Father Charles Goes Down And Ends Battle\'（F C G D A E B）。向前是更多升号。C 有 0 个升号，G 有 1 个，依此类推。\n- 降号：\'Battle Ends And Down Goes Charles\\\' Father\'（B E A D G C F）。向前是更多降号。Bb 有 2 个降号，Eb 有 3 个，依此类推。\n提示：序列会绕回开头。',
    'ja-JP': '調号の語呂合わせ:\n- シャープ: \'Father Charles Goes Down And Ends Battle\'（F C G D A E B）。進むほどシャープが増えます。C は 0、G は 1 です。\n- フラット: \'Battle Ends And Down Goes Charles\\\' Father\'（B E A D G C F）。進むほどフラットが増えます。Bb は 2、Eb は 3 です。\nヒント: 並びは一周します。',
    'ko-KR': '조표 암기:\n- 샵: \'Father Charles Goes Down And Ends Battle\' (F C G D A E B). 앞으로 갈수록 샵이 늘어납니다. C는 0개, G는 1개입니다.\n- 플랫: \'Battle Ends And Down Goes Charles\\\' Father\' (B E A D G C F). 앞으로 갈수록 플랫이 늘어납니다. Bb는 2개, Eb는 3개입니다.\n힌트: 순서는 처음으로 돌아옵니다.',
  },
